    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56338" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέβλος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dog-faced baboon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέγκλος</span></b> , ὁ, an unknown <i>sea-bird</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεγνώειν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεθραῦσθαι, τετρύσθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέγχει:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδάκνει</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέγχρα</span></b> , ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέγχρος</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				91
			</span></i>.</div>
